graph TD
    %% ER Cargo Selection
    A[Protein in ER Lumen] --> B{OR: ER Exit<br/>Signal?}
    B -->|Yes - Export Signal| C[Cargo Selection]
    B -->|No - ER Retention| D[KDEL/KKXX Retained]
    B -->|Transmembrane| E[TM Domain Packaging]
    
    D --> F([ER Resident Protein])
    
    %% COPII Coat Assembly Initiation
    C --> G[Sec12 GEF at ER Exit Sites]
    E --> G
    G --> H[Sar1-GDP Recruitment]
    H --> I[Sec12 Catalyzes GDP→GTP Exchange]
    I --> J[Sar1-GTP Formation]
    
    %% Membrane Insertion
    J --> K[Sar1-GTP Conformational Change]
    K --> L[Amphipathic Helix Exposure]
    L --> M[Helix Inserts into ER Membrane]
    M --> N[Membrane Curvature Induction]
    
    %% Sec23/24 Recruitment
    N --> O{AND: Sec23/24<br/>Heterodimer?}
    O -->|No| P[Coat Assembly Fails]
    O -->|Yes| Q[Sec23/24 Binds Sar1-GTP]
    
    Q --> R[Cargo Binding by Sec24]
    R --> S{AND: Cargo<br/>Captured?}
    S -->|No| P
    S -->|Yes| T[Inner Coat Layer]
    
    %% Sec13/31 Outer Coat
    T --> U{AND: Sec13/31<br/>Heterotetramer?}
    U -->|No| P
    U -->|Yes| V[Sec13/31 Polymerization]
    
    V --> W[Outer Coat Cage Formation]
    W --> X[Cuboctahedral Lattice]
    X --> Y[Complete COPII Coat]
    
    %% Vesicle Scission
    Y --> Z{AND: Membrane<br/>Fission Factors?}
    Z -->|No| AA[Budding Stalled]
    Z -->|Yes| AB[Membrane Scission]
    
    AB --> AC[Vesicle Released from ER]
    AC --> AD[Free COPII Vesicle]
    
    %% Coat Disassembly
    AD --> AE[Sec23 GAP Activity]
    AE --> AF[Sar1-GTP Hydrolysis]
    AF --> AG[Sar1-GDP + Pi]
    AG --> AH[Sar1 Membrane Dissociation]
    AH --> AI[Coat Disassembly]
    AI --> AJ[Naked Vesicle]
    
    %% Ypt1 Rab GTPase Recruitment
    AJ --> AK{AND: Ypt1-GTP<br/>Present?}
    AK -->|No| AL[/Vesicle Cannot Dock/]
    AK -->|Yes| AM[Ypt1 Marks Vesicle Identity]
    
    %% Tethering to Golgi
    AM --> AN[TRAPP Complex Recognition]
    AN --> AO{AND: All TRAPP<br/>Subunits?}
    AO -->|No| AL
    AO -->|Yes| AP[TRAPP I Tethering Complex]
    
    AP --> AQ[Long-Range Vesicle Capture]
    AQ --> AR[Vesicle Tethered to Golgi]
    
    %% SNARE Pairing
    AR --> AS[v-SNARE Bet1/Bos1]
    AS --> AT[t-SNAREs Sed5/Sec22]
    
    AT --> AU{AND: All 4<br/>SNAREs?}
    AU -->|No - Missing SNARE| AV[/Fusion Blocked/]
    AU -->|Yes - Complete Set| AW[SNARE Complex Assembly]
    
    %% Trans-SNARE to Cis-SNARE
    AW --> AX[Trans-SNARE Complex]
    AX --> AY[4-Helix Bundle Formation]
    AY --> AZ{AND: Coiled-Coil<br/>Zippering?}
    AZ -->|No| AV
    AZ -->|Yes| BA[SNARE Zippering]
    
    BA --> BB[Membranes Pulled Together]
    BB --> BC[Hemifusion Intermediate]
    
    %% Membrane Fusion
    BC --> BD{AND: Sec17/18<br/>Present?}
    BD -->|No| BE[Fusion Incomplete]
    BD -->|Yes| BF[Full Membrane Fusion]
    
    BF --> BG[Pore Formation]
    BG --> BH[Cargo Released into Golgi]
    BH --> BI[Cis-SNARE Complex]
    
    %% SNARE Recycling
    BI --> BJ[Sec18/NSF ATPase]
    BJ --> BK[Sec17/α-SNAP Adaptor]
    BK --> BL{AND: ATP<br/>Hydrolysis?}
    BL -->|No| BM[SNAREs Stuck]
    BL -->|Yes| BN[SNARE Complex Disassembly]
    
    BN --> BO[SNAREs Recycled]
    BO --> BP[Ready for Next Round]
    
    %% Golgi Processing
    BH --> BQ{OR: Next<br/>Destination?}
    BQ -->|Plasma Membrane| BR[Sec4-Mediated Secretion]
    BQ -->|Vacuole| BS[VPS Pathway]
    BQ -->|ER Return| BT[COPI Retrograde]
    
    BR --> BU[Exocyst Complex]
    BU --> BV{AND: All 8<br/>Exocyst Subunits?}
    BV -->|No| BW[Secretion Fails]
    BV -->|Yes| BX[PM Fusion]
    BX --> BY([Protein Secreted])
    
    BS --> BZ([Vacuolar Delivery])
    BT --> CA([ER Recycling])
    P --> CB[/Transport Blocked/]
    AV --> CB
    
